{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_031_ch_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_031_ch_01_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "018418de13cd0b4e9033a8764a11df9dd7bb92e9402bf17c309e96a645dc466c", "ja": "いやぁ、一時はどうなることかと思ったぜ。千鶴\nが牛の目を見つめたら暴走が止まったけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，刚才还真不知道会变成什么样呢。虽说千鹤\n盯着牛的眼睛之后它就不再暴走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_031_ch_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_031_ch_01_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "2f8f5128f9cfdea9c67c4f430cf044758dec4c2e5649d298995dc425f01a5d6d", "ja": "どうしてあんなことができたんですか！？　\nどうして……！？　セレブだからですか？", "zh": "为什么能做到那种事！？  \n为什么……！？难道是因为你是名媛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
